{"ID":"20240206094933-bt020tq","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206094933-bt020tq","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206094933-bt020tq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206094945-77rosk0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206094940-by3y41a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206094945-okmq9x4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:1,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:1\u0026#125;","title":"禇实子（楮实子）","type":"doc","updated":"20240902142826"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206094945-okmq9x4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206094945-okmq9x4","updated":"20240206094953"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于山西、甘肃、河北、湖南、湖北等地区。\n【性状】\t小瘦果扁圆形或扁卵形，长约2mm，宽1.5"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2mm。表面橙红色或棕红色，有微细网状纹理或颗料状突起，一侧边具凹沟，另侧边具棱线，基部有子房残痕。质硬，内含种子1粒；种皮红棕色，种仁白色，油质。味淡。\n【性味】\t甘，寒。\n【功效】\t补肾清肝、明目、利尿。用于腰膝酸软、虚劳骨蒸、头晕目昏、目生翳膜、水肿胀满。"}]},{"ID":"20240206094940-by3y41a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206094940-by3y41a","updated":"20240206094940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206094940-jcfyzvu.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715093706-cfqvnx7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715093706-cfqvnx7","updated":"20240715093706"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240221193103-632uagh.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715093706-t292fsa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715093706-t292fsa","updated":"20240715093706"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 576px;","style":"width: 566px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"构树 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/构树 2-20240715091127-aoa6f00.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 566px;\" parent-style=\"width: 576px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 645px;","style":"width: 635px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"构树 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/构树 4-20240715091748-3oqjm5b.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 635px;\" parent-style=\"width: 645px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715093706-g89l5xk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715093706-g89l5xk","updated":"20240715093706"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 710px;","style":"width: 700px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"构树 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/构树 3-20240715091719-jz6bzue.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 700px;\" parent-style=\"width: 710px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 536px;","style":"width: 526px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"Nod